Food's stuck in my throat!

00:15:50.450 --> 00:15:52.660
Hey, Aria! Are you gonna be okay?

00:15:55.410 --> 00:15:59.540
My chest is so bouncy that it
was hard to get a good hit in.

00:15:59.540 --> 00:16:00.550
Goddamn it!

00:16:03.260 --> 00:16:07.010
I spent that entire day
staking out the Tsuda residence,

00:16:07.010 --> 00:16:10.300
but I never spotted the
love affair I was looking for.

00:16:10.720 --> 00:16:12.010
Too bad.

00:16:12.010 --> 00:16:13.720
What is wrong with you, Hata?

00:16:13.720 --> 00:16:15.430
We're done with the make-ups!

00:16:15.430 --> 00:16:17.980
I refuse to give up, though.

00:16:17.980 --> 00:16:21.070
One day, I'll have you leaving
with your tail between your legs!

00:16:21.650 --> 00:16:24.530
So here. Put these on.

00:16:24.530 --> 00:16:28.070
Don't try to make people
cosplay for dubious reasons.

00:16:34.250 --> 00:16:35.870
Here's what we have today.

00:16:35.870 --> 00:16:36.870
Ahh...

00:16:36.870 --> 00:16:37.460
This can't be good.

00:16:37.460 --> 00:16:38.750
What could it be?

00:16:38.750 --> 00:16:39.420
I bet this is going to end in another forced punchline.

00:16:39.420 --> 00:16:41.710
What could it be?

00:16:41.710 --> 00:16:44.510
The correct answer is: a vibrator!

00:16:44.510 --> 00:16:45.760
Whoa! It was exactly what it looked like!

00:16:45.760 --> 00:16:47.300
It's vibrating!

00:16:48.090 --> 00:16:52.510
Now I'm sure you're all aware, but next week...

00:16:52.510 --> 00:16:53.260
we have this.

00:16:58.390 --> 00:17:00.310
Oh.

00:17:00.310 --> 00:17:04.230
I thought it said "Golden Shower" for a second there.

00:17:04.230 --> 00:17:05.230
That gave me a start!

00:17:05.230 --> 00:17:08.150
Her lust clouded her vision!

00:17:11.620 --> 00:17:14.990
We should use this
long holiday to go somewhere.

00:17:14.990 --> 00:17:16.160
Yeah.

00:17:16.500 --> 00:17:20.750
I hope we have a fun Golden Week!

00:17:23.920 --> 00:17:28.170
The moment I laid eyes on Prez's smile,
my heart skipped a beat...

00:17:28.170 --> 00:17:30.510
as I realized she was likely up to something.

00:17:47.690 --> 00:17:49.570
Wow!

00:17:50.070 --> 00:17:51.990
There's nobody else here!

00:17:51.990 --> 00:17:53.570
We have the whole park to ourselves.

00:17:53.570 --> 00:17:55.240
I hope you all have a blast today.

00:17:56.410 --> 00:18:01.710
Nothing you say will ever shock us
anymore, Shichijou-senpai.

00:18:05.420 --> 00:18:09.300
To tell you the truth, this isn't
a black sweater. It's body paint.

00:18:09.300 --> 00:18:10.420
What?!

00:18:10.420 --> 00:18:12.090
Put an actual one on!

00:18:12.090 --> 00:18:12.760
<b>Body-Paint</b>

00:18:12.760 --> 00:18:13.140
It's a body-paint sweater!
<b>Body-Paint</b>

00:18:13.140 --> 00:18:15.680
It's a body-paint sweater!

00:18:15.680 --> 00:18:17.010
I'm a bit disappointed.

00:18:18.100 --> 00:18:21.980
Everyone, welcome to your part-time jobs
testing out the rides here.

00:18:22.770 --> 00:18:25.820
This kind of thing actually happens abroad.

00:18:27.480 --> 00:18:30.610
Getting to ride these for free
sounds like a pretty good job.

00:18:31.740 --> 00:18:35.870
First, please ride the rollercoaster thirty times.

00:18:39.950 --> 00:18:41.750
Hagimura, what do you measure in at?

00:18:41.750 --> 00:18:43.370
Tsuda!

00:18:43.370 --> 00:18:45.670
You asked a lady what her measurements are?!

00:18:45.670 --> 00:18:47.130
How tactless <i>are</i> you?!

00:18:47.880 --> 00:18:50.510
But this is a matter of life and death.

00:18:55.930 --> 00:18:57.850
Come to think of it, Prez,

00:18:57.850 --> 00:18:59.930
aren't you scared of heights?

00:18:59.930 --> 00:19:00.890
I am.

00:19:00.890 --> 00:19:03.350
Fun things don't count, though.

00:19:03.350 --> 00:19:05.270
I see.

00:19:05.770 --> 00:19:10.190
It's like how some people enjoy hot candle wax even though they can't stand hot weather.

00:19:10.190 --> 00:19:11.070
That's a different kind of "hot"—

00:19:14.070 --> 00:19:14.910
What about this?

00:19:14.910 --> 00:19:16.530
Doesn't count, of course!

00:19:16.530 --> 00:19:18.660
Here it comes!

00:19:18.660 --> 00:19:19.870
It's coming!

00:19:19.870 --> 00:19:21.500
Here we go—

00:19:21.500 --> 00:19:23.790
No, this kind of stuff is definitely <i>not</i> on!

00:19:24.330 --> 00:19:26.670
This place is fantastic, too!

00:19:31.300 --> 00:19:32.670
Slide!

00:19:33.170 --> 00:19:33.800
Splash!

00:19:33.800 --> 00:19:37.970
Slide! Splash!

00:19:38.390 --> 00:19:43.180
She said she'd go down that slide a
few dozen times to make sure it's safe.

00:19:43.180 --> 00:19:45.480
The skin on her butt might peel off.

00:19:45.480 --> 00:19:46.650
Wait!

00:19:46.650 --> 00:19:47.730
That means...

00:19:48.270 --> 00:19:51.360
If someone with phimosis goes down
this slide multiple times on his belly...

00:19:51.360 --> 00:19:54.360
Might as well go announce that at some academic conference.

00:19:54.360 --> 00:19:56.570
Waiting.

00:20:02.120 --> 00:20:03.950
What an incredible view.

00:20:03.950 --> 00:20:06.370
Apparently it's even prettier at night.

00:20:07.080 --> 00:20:10.750
If a couple were to ride the ferris wheel then...

00:20:10.750 --> 00:20:12.380
they'd get cozy...

00:20:12.380 --> 00:20:15.050
and suck face!

00:20:15.050 --> 00:20:18.260
Couldn't they have just said "kiss" instead?

00:20:23.270 --> 00:20:25.230
Please lick every last inch of it.

00:20:26.270 --> 00:20:27.310
Hey!

00:20:27.310 --> 00:20:28.980
This is awesome!

00:20:43.040 --> 00:20:45.330
I'm exhausted, but I had a lot of fun.

00:20:45.330 --> 00:20:46.500
Me too.

00:20:47.040 --> 00:20:48.290
Wow...

00:20:49.080 --> 00:20:51.210
Let's visit again after the official opening.

00:20:51.210 --> 00:20:52.000
Yeah!

00:20:52.000 --> 00:20:54.090
Sure, let's do that.

00:20:54.090 --> 00:20:55.670
Agreed!

00:20:58.050 --> 00:21:02.390
But we're <i>so</i> done with rides right now.

00:21:02.390 --> 00:21:03.810
Dessert is ready.

00:21:04.310 --> 00:21:05.060
All right!

00:21:05.060 --> 00:21:06.730
I'm gonna ride the ferris wheel next time!

00:21:06.730 --> 00:21:08.600
Huh? Will you be okay?

00:21:08.600 --> 00:21:11.730
The height might not bother me
if I go commando!

00:21:11.730 --> 00:21:14.480
You should get on a see-through gondola, then!

00:21:14.480 --> 00:21:16.400
And of course, you're going full monty, Tsuda!

00:21:16.400 --> 00:21:18.450
Aww y—hell no!

00:22:51.960 --> 00:22:54.170
Today was so much fun!

00:22:54.170 --> 00:22:55.420
Yeah, right?

00:22:55.920 --> 00:22:58.670
My eyes have been opened
to a new form of pleasure.

00:22:58.670 --> 00:22:59.550
Huh?

00:22:59.550 --> 00:23:03.840
But hadn't you gone on all of those rides before at other amusement parks?

00:23:04.590 --> 00:23:05.680
Well...

00:23:05.680 --> 00:23:09.560
Thing is, my panties got wet
during the flume ride.

00:23:10.180 --> 00:23:12.520
I went commando from then on
until we got home.

00:23:13.850 --> 00:23:16.400
My eyes have been opened to a new world.

00:23:17.060 --> 00:23:18.480
Quiet, young lady!

00:23:21.900 --> 00:23:23.450
Yokoshima Naruko here.

00:23:23.450 --> 00:23:27.200
Next, the Judo Club, which I raised with
tender care, will set off on a new journey.

00:23:27.200 --> 00:23:28.200
Hey, you're the student council's advisor!

00:23:28.200 --> 00:23:32.370
Next episode, we'll mainly be covering chapters 96 and 97, in volume 5.

00:23:32.370 --> 00:23:34.160
Watch it, or I'll take your virginity!

00:23:34.160 --> 00:23:35.420
Run away!
